{
  "video_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo",
  "duration_s": 547.0,
  "generated_at": "2026-09-04T02:59:52.485892+00:00",
  "sentences": [
    {
      "sent_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo:s0000",
      "video_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo",
      "idx": 0,
      "start_s": 0.0,
      "end_s": 8.48,
      "text": "Somewhere in Germany right now, a man with a shovel is standing over a grave that hasn't had a visitor in 26 years.",
      "n_words": 23
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo:s0001",
      "video_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo",
      "idx": 1,
      "start_s": 6.52,
      "end_s": 10.16,
      "text": "He's not there to mourn.",
      "n_words": 5
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo:s0002",
      "video_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo",
      "idx": 2,
      "start_s": 6.52,
      "end_s": 12.120000000000001,
      "text": "He's there to dig it up.",
      "n_words": 6
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo:s0003",
      "video_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo",
      "idx": 3,
      "start_s": 8.48,
      "end_s": 14.56,
      "text": "By the end of the week, the headstone will be gone.",
      "n_words": 11
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo:s0004",
      "video_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo",
      "idx": 4,
      "start_s": 10.16,
      "end_s": 16.48,
      "text": "The plot will be smoothed flat and sown with grass.",
      "n_words": 10
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo:s0005",
      "video_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo",
      "idx": 5,
      "start_s": 12.12,
      "end_s": 20.76,
      "text": "And in a few months, someone else will be lowered into the same hole.",
      "n_words": 14
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo:s0006",
      "video_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo",
      "idx": 6,
      "start_s": 16.48,
      "end_s": 22.92,
      "text": "This isn't a horror story.",
      "n_words": 5
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo:s0007",
      "video_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo",
      "idx": 7,
      "start_s": 18.64,
      "end_s": 22.92,
      "text": "It's routine.",
      "n_words": 2
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo:s0008",
      "video_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo",
      "idx": 8,
      "start_s": 18.64,
      "end_s": 30.72,
      "text": "In most countries, when the family stops paying or stops existing, the plot eventually gets reused.",
      "n_words": 16
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo:s0009",
      "video_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo",
      "idx": 9,
      "start_s": 25.4,
      "end_s": 30.72,
      "text": "Workers dig up the bones.",
      "n_words": 5
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo:s0010",
      "video_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo",
      "idx": 10,
      "start_s": 25.4,
      "end_s": 32.72,
      "text": "A new coffin takes the spot.",
      "n_words": 6
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo:s0011",
      "video_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo",
      "idx": 11,
      "start_s": 28.24,
      "end_s": 34.64,
      "text": "In Britain, they don't even move the bones.",
      "n_words": 8
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo:s0012",
      "video_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo",
      "idx": 12,
      "start_s": 30.72,
      "end_s": 39.96,
      "text": "The City of London Cemetery has been quietly stacking the dead since 2007.",
      "n_words": 13
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo:s0013",
      "video_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo",
      "idx": 13,
      "start_s": 34.64,
      "end_s": 42.04,
      "text": "They call it lift and deepen.",
      "n_words": 6
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo:s0014",
      "video_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo",
      "idx": 14,
      "start_s": 37.64,
      "end_s": 49.16,
      "text": "They dig the hole deeper, push the original skeleton to the bottom, and drop a fresh coffin on top.",
      "n_words": 19
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo:s0015",
      "video_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo",
      "idx": 15,
      "start_s": 44.04,
      "end_s": 49.16,
      "text": "Two strangers, one plot.",
      "n_words": 4
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo:s0016",
      "video_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo",
      "idx": 16,
      "start_s": 44.04,
      "end_s": 57.36,
      "text": "In some places, including most of the United States, the headstone just stays where it is, wearing down while the world forgets who's underneath.",
      "n_words": 24
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo:s0017",
      "video_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo",
      "idx": 17,
      "start_s": 53.6,
      "end_s": 58.96,
      "text": "The legal status doesn't matter.",
      "n_words": 5
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo:s0018",
      "video_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo",
      "idx": 18,
      "start_s": 55.64,
      "end_s": 63.28,
      "text": "The visiting stops within three generations regardless.",
      "n_words": 7
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo:s0019",
      "video_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo",
      "idx": 19,
      "start_s": 58.96,
      "end_s": 67.8,
      "text": "A grave nobody visits is already gone, whether or not anyone with a shovel ever comes to make it official.",
      "n_words": 20
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo:s0020",
      "video_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo",
      "idx": 20,
      "start_s": 65.56,
      "end_s": 72.47999999999999,
      "text": "Most people still believe in perpetual rest.",
      "n_words": 7
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo:s0021",
      "video_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo",
      "idx": 21,
      "start_s": 67.8,
      "end_s": 74.39999999999999,
      "text": "They grew up thinking a grave is forever.",
      "n_words": 8
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo:s0022",
      "video_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo",
      "idx": 22,
      "start_s": 69.88,
      "end_s": 78.76,
      "text": "A stone, a name, a patch of grass that belongs to a family for eternity.",
      "n_words": 15
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo:s0023",
      "video_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo",
      "idx": 23,
      "start_s": 74.4,
      "end_s": 82.84,
      "text": "The permanent grave was invented in 1831 when Mount Auburn Cemetery opened outside Boston.",
      "n_words": 14
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo:s0024",
      "video_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo",
      "idx": 24,
      "start_s": 78.76,
      "end_s": 89.19999999999999,
      "text": "The first cemetery in America designed to look like a park with private family plots that would never be disturbed.",
      "n_words": 20
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo:s0025",
      "video_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo",
      "idx": 25,
      "start_s": 84.88,
      "end_s": 96.16000000000001,
      "text": "It was sold to a middle class who wanted something more dignified than the crowded urban churchyards of the previous generation.",
      "n_words": 21
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo:s0026",
      "video_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo",
      "idx": 26,
      "start_s": 92.4,
      "end_s": 106.08000000000001,
      "text": "We forgot so completely that when we look at a cemetery today, we think we're looking at the natural way humans have always treated their dead.",
      "n_words": 26
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo:s0027",
      "video_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo",
      "idx": 27,
      "start_s": 100.76,
      "end_s": 107.92,
      "text": "We're looking at a marketing campaign from 1831.",
      "n_words": 8
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo:s0028",
      "video_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo",
      "idx": 28,
      "start_s": 102.8,
      "end_s": 109.28,
      "text": "First, the visitor stopped coming.",
      "n_words": 5
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo:s0029",
      "video_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo",
      "idx": 29,
      "start_s": 106.08,
      "end_s": 111.56,
      "text": "Then, the flowers stopped arriving.",
      "n_words": 5
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo:s0030",
      "video_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo",
      "idx": 30,
      "start_s": 107.92,
      "end_s": 114.28,
      "text": "The decorations vanish.",
      "n_words": 3
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo:s0031",
      "video_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo",
      "idx": 31,
      "start_s": 109.28,
      "end_s": 117.08,
      "text": "Over the decades, the lettering thins until it blurs.",
      "n_words": 9
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo:s0032",
      "video_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo",
      "idx": 32,
      "start_s": 111.56,
      "end_s": 122.0,
      "text": "The stone collects lichen, develops a tilt, sometimes falls.",
      "n_words": 9
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo:s0033",
      "video_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo",
      "idx": 33,
      "start_s": 117.08,
      "end_s": 124.64,
      "text": "The plot flattens back into the surrounding grass.",
      "n_words": 8
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo:s0034",
      "video_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo",
      "idx": 34,
      "start_s": 119.92,
      "end_s": 129.36,
      "text": "After 100 years, the stone might still stand, but the name on it is just a worn shape.",
      "n_words": 18
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo:s0035",
      "video_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo",
      "idx": 35,
      "start_s": 126.92,
      "end_s": 133.76000000000002,
      "text": "After 300, the cemetery itself is probably gone.",
      "n_words": 8
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo:s0036",
      "video_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo",
      "idx": 36,
      "start_s": 129.36,
      "end_s": 134.88000000000002,
      "text": "The grave doesn't disappear, it just stops being a grave.",
      "n_words": 10
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo:s0037",
      "video_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo",
      "idx": 37,
      "start_s": 133.76,
      "end_s": 142.51999999999998,
      "text": "Try naming all of your great-grandparents, first and last names.",
      "n_words": 10
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo:s0038",
      "video_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo",
      "idx": 38,
      "start_s": 136.76,
      "end_s": 142.51999999999998,
      "text": "96 out of 100 people can't.",
      "n_words": 6
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo:s0039",
      "video_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo",
      "idx": 39,
      "start_s": 136.76,
      "end_s": 148.92000000000002,
      "text": "They were alive less than 100 years ago, holding the babies who became your grandparents.",
      "n_words": 15
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo:s0040",
      "video_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo",
      "idx": 40,
      "start_s": 144.4,
      "end_s": 151.08,
      "text": "Without them, you wouldn't exist.",
      "n_words": 5
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo:s0041",
      "video_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo",
      "idx": 41,
      "start_s": 146.72,
      "end_s": 151.08,
      "text": "You forgot them.",
      "n_words": 3
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo:s0042",
      "video_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo",
      "idx": 42,
      "start_s": 148.92,
      "end_s": 153.23999999999998,
      "text": "Completely.",
      "n_words": 1
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo:s0043",
      "video_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo",
      "idx": 43,
      "start_s": 148.92,
      "end_s": 153.23999999999998,
      "text": "Three generations.",
      "n_words": 2
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo:s0044",
      "video_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo",
      "idx": 44,
      "start_s": 148.92,
      "end_s": 156.0,
      "text": "That's the average lifespan of human memory.",
      "n_words": 7
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo:s0045",
      "video_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo",
      "idx": 45,
      "start_s": 153.24,
      "end_s": 159.959,
      "text": "After about 70 to 90 years, almost everyone is forgotten.",
      "n_words": 10
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo:s0046",
      "video_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo",
      "idx": 46,
      "start_s": 156.0,
      "end_s": 162.48000000000002,
      "text": "And it doesn't always wait for death.",
      "n_words": 7
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo:s0047",
      "video_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo",
      "idx": 47,
      "start_s": 157.8,
      "end_s": 168.04,
      "text": "In Japan, they have a word for it, kodokushi, which means lonely death.",
      "n_words": 13
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo:s0048",
      "video_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo",
      "idx": 48,
      "start_s": 162.48,
      "end_s": 173.79999999999998,
      "text": "Every year, more than 70,000 Japanese die alone in their homes.",
      "n_words": 11
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo:s0049",
      "video_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo",
      "idx": 49,
      "start_s": 168.04,
      "end_s": 175.83999999999997,
      "text": "Around 4,000 bodies are found more than a month after the death.",
      "n_words": 12
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo:s0050",
      "video_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo",
      "idx": 50,
      "start_s": 170.92,
      "end_s": 177.68,
      "text": "Some, over a year.",
      "n_words": 4
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo:s0051",
      "video_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo",
      "idx": 51,
      "start_s": 173.8,
      "end_s": 179.4,
      "text": "The smell tells the neighbors first.",
      "n_words": 6
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo:s0052",
      "video_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo",
      "idx": 52,
      "start_s": 175.84,
      "end_s": 184.20000000000002,
      "text": "There are companies that specialize in cleaning these apartments, a growing industry.",
      "n_words": 12
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo:s0053",
      "video_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo",
      "idx": 53,
      "start_s": 179.4,
      "end_s": 186.07999999999998,
      "text": "Most kodokushi victims have living family.",
      "n_words": 6
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo:s0054",
      "video_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo",
      "idx": 54,
      "start_s": 184.2,
      "end_s": 188.92,
      "text": "They just stopped calling.",
      "n_words": 4
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo:s0055",
      "video_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo",
      "idx": 55,
      "start_s": 184.2,
      "end_s": 196.56,
      "text": "Children still alive, cousins, old friends, people who could have visited and didn't.",
      "n_words": 13
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo:s0056",
      "video_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo",
      "idx": 56,
      "start_s": 190.959,
      "end_s": 199.04,
      "text": "The grave gets unvisited before the grave even exists.",
      "n_words": 9
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo:s0057",
      "video_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo",
      "idx": 57,
      "start_s": 194.12,
      "end_s": 202.84,
      "text": "Even Mozart didn't escape this.",
      "n_words": 5
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo:s0058",
      "video_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo",
      "idx": 58,
      "start_s": 196.56,
      "end_s": 209.72,
      "text": "He died in Vienna in 1791 at 35, a third-class funeral, an unmarked common grave at St. Mark's Cemetery.",
      "n_words": 19
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo:s0059",
      "video_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo",
      "idx": 59,
      "start_s": 204.959,
      "end_s": 214.28,
      "text": "About a decade later, the grave was reused, normal procedure even for him.",
      "n_words": 13
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo:s0060",
      "video_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo",
      "idx": 60,
      "start_s": 209.72,
      "end_s": 216.959,
      "text": "His widow tried to find the spot.",
      "n_words": 7
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo:s0061",
      "video_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo",
      "idx": 61,
      "start_s": 211.8,
      "end_s": 216.959,
      "text": "Nobody could.",
      "n_words": 2
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo:s0062",
      "video_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo",
      "idx": 62,
      "start_s": 211.8,
      "end_s": 219.4,
      "text": "Mozart's remains have been lost for over 200 years.",
      "n_words": 9
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo:s0063",
      "video_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo",
      "idx": 63,
      "start_s": 214.28,
      "end_s": 222.08,
      "text": "The monument in Vienna is a guess.",
      "n_words": 7
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo:s0064",
      "video_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo",
      "idx": 64,
      "start_s": 216.959,
      "end_s": 224.6,
      "text": "And Mozart isn't the strangest case.",
      "n_words": 6
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo:s0065",
      "video_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo",
      "idx": 65,
      "start_s": 219.4,
      "end_s": 231.519,
      "text": "In the mid-1920s, the biggest movie star on Earth was Rudolph Valentino.",
      "n_words": 12
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo:s0066",
      "video_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo",
      "idx": 66,
      "start_s": 224.6,
      "end_s": 233.96,
      "text": "He died in 1926 at 31.",
      "n_words": 6
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo:s0067",
      "video_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo",
      "idx": 67,
      "start_s": 227.4,
      "end_s": 236.68,
      "text": "100,000 mourners filled the streets of New York.",
      "n_words": 8
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo:s0068",
      "video_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo",
      "idx": 68,
      "start_s": 231.519,
      "end_s": 236.68,
      "text": "Riots broke out.",
      "n_words": 3
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo:s0069",
      "video_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo",
      "idx": 69,
      "start_s": 233.96,
      "end_s": 238.56,
      "text": "Women fainted.",
      "n_words": 2
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo:s0070",
      "video_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo",
      "idx": 70,
      "start_s": 233.96,
      "end_s": 241.04000000000002,
      "text": "Today, you've probably never heard of him.",
      "n_words": 7
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo:s0071",
      "video_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo",
      "idx": 71,
      "start_s": 236.68,
      "end_s": 243.2,
      "text": "A hundred years from worldwide fame to a blank.",
      "n_words": 9
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo:s0072",
      "video_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo",
      "idx": 72,
      "start_s": 238.56,
      "end_s": 246.12,
      "text": "We couldn't keep Mozart's body.",
      "n_words": 5
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo:s0073",
      "video_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo",
      "idx": 73,
      "start_s": 241.04,
      "end_s": 248.83999999999997,
      "text": "We couldn't keep Valentino's name.",
      "n_words": 5
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo:s0074",
      "video_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo",
      "idx": 74,
      "start_s": 243.2,
      "end_s": 251.52,
      "text": "Neither will we keep yours.",
      "n_words": 5
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo:s0075",
      "video_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo",
      "idx": 75,
      "start_s": 246.12,
      "end_s": 253.76,
      "text": "The neuroscientist David Eagleman wrote that we don't die once.",
      "n_words": 10
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo:s0076",
      "video_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo",
      "idx": 76,
      "start_s": 248.84,
      "end_s": 256.32,
      "text": "We die three times.",
      "n_words": 4
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo:s0077",
      "video_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo",
      "idx": 77,
      "start_s": 251.52,
      "end_s": 258.64,
      "text": "The first death is when your body stops.",
      "n_words": 8
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo:s0078",
      "video_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo",
      "idx": 78,
      "start_s": 253.76,
      "end_s": 261.079,
      "text": "The second is when the body is put in the ground or burned.",
      "n_words": 13
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo:s0079",
      "video_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo",
      "idx": 79,
      "start_s": 256.32,
      "end_s": 263.36,
      "text": "The third is the one nobody talks about.",
      "n_words": 8
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo:s0080",
      "video_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo",
      "idx": 80,
      "start_s": 258.64,
      "end_s": 270.16,
      "text": "The moment, sometime in the future, when somebody says your name out loud for the very last time.",
      "n_words": 18
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo:s0081",
      "video_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo",
      "idx": 81,
      "start_s": 266.04,
      "end_s": 274.84000000000003,
      "text": "For most people, the third death comes about three generations after the first.",
      "n_words": 13
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo:s0082",
      "video_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo",
      "idx": 82,
      "start_s": 270.16,
      "end_s": 279.59999999999997,
      "text": "The same three generations that already erased your great-grandparents.",
      "n_words": 9
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo:s0083",
      "video_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo",
      "idx": 83,
      "start_s": 274.84,
      "end_s": 281.71999999999997,
      "text": "Your children will remember you in detail.",
      "n_words": 7
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo:s0084",
      "video_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo",
      "idx": 84,
      "start_s": 277.4,
      "end_s": 285.76000000000005,
      "text": "Your voice, the way you smelled, the hands when you got old.",
      "n_words": 12
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo:s0085",
      "video_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo",
      "idx": 85,
      "start_s": 281.72,
      "end_s": 287.76,
      "text": "Your grandchildren will remember fragments.",
      "n_words": 5
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo:s0086",
      "video_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo",
      "idx": 86,
      "start_s": 283.52,
      "end_s": 292.56,
      "text": "A story, a photograph, the smell of your house on holidays.",
      "n_words": 11
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo:s0087",
      "video_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo",
      "idx": 87,
      "start_s": 287.76,
      "end_s": 299.76000000000005,
      "text": "Your great-grandchildren will know your name on a family tree, if that, and roughly what you did for a living.",
      "n_words": 20
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo:s0088",
      "video_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo",
      "idx": 88,
      "start_s": 294.72,
      "end_s": 301.919,
      "text": "Your great-great-grandchildren won't even know you existed.",
      "n_words": 7
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo:s0089",
      "video_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo",
      "idx": 89,
      "start_s": 297.24,
      "end_s": 309.04,
      "text": "Some last longer because somebody became famous or kept a diary or had a great-great-grandchild obsessed with family history.",
      "n_words": 19
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo:s0090",
      "video_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo",
      "idx": 90,
      "start_s": 304.8,
      "end_s": 311.4,
      "text": "For most, three generations is the ceiling.",
      "n_words": 7
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo:s0091",
      "video_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo",
      "idx": 91,
      "start_s": 306.919,
      "end_s": 315.56,
      "text": "But the same three generations also erase everyone who ever judged you.",
      "n_words": 12
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo:s0092",
      "video_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo",
      "idx": 92,
      "start_s": 311.4,
      "end_s": 323.35999999999996,
      "text": "The boss, the relatives who counted your failures, the old friends who turned cold and talk behind your back.",
      "n_words": 19
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo:s0093",
      "video_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo",
      "idx": 93,
      "start_s": 317.919,
      "end_s": 326.15999999999997,
      "text": "All of them gone on the same timeline.",
      "n_words": 8
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo:s0094",
      "video_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo",
      "idx": 94,
      "start_s": 320.32,
      "end_s": 327.91900000000004,
      "text": "The shame dies with them.",
      "n_words": 5
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo:s0095",
      "video_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo",
      "idx": 95,
      "start_s": 323.36,
      "end_s": 330.28000000000003,
      "text": "Marcus Aurelius noticed this 2,000 years ago.",
      "n_words": 7
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo:s0096",
      "video_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo",
      "idx": 96,
      "start_s": 326.16,
      "end_s": 332.64,
      "text": "The people you're trying to impress are about to be dust.",
      "n_words": 11
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo:s0097",
      "video_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo",
      "idx": 97,
      "start_s": 330.28,
      "end_s": 337.32,
      "text": "Anthropologists say your real audience is around 150.",
      "n_words": 8
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo:s0098",
      "video_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo",
      "idx": 98,
      "start_s": 332.64,
      "end_s": 339.52000000000004,
      "text": "Everyone else is a stranger you've been performing for.",
      "n_words": 9
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo:s0099",
      "video_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo",
      "idx": 99,
      "start_s": 337.32,
      "end_s": 341.4,
      "text": "Even you forgot yourself.",
      "n_words": 4
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo:s0100",
      "video_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo",
      "idx": 100,
      "start_s": 337.32,
      "end_s": 348.32,
      "text": "The childhood friend you swore you'd never lose touch with, whose face you can't picture anymore.",
      "n_words": 16
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo:s0101",
      "video_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo",
      "idx": 101,
      "start_s": 343.44,
      "end_s": 350.76,
      "text": "The dream you held in your 20s, you can barely remember why it mattered.",
      "n_words": 14
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo:s0102",
      "video_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo",
      "idx": 102,
      "start_s": 348.32,
      "end_s": 354.68,
      "text": "10 years ago, you cared about completely different things.",
      "n_words": 9
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo:s0103",
      "video_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo",
      "idx": 103,
      "start_s": 350.76,
      "end_s": 356.64,
      "text": "The forgetting isn't waiting for you to die.",
      "n_words": 8
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo:s0104",
      "video_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo",
      "idx": 104,
      "start_s": 353.08,
      "end_s": 359.24,
      "text": "It's been happening your whole life.",
      "n_words": 6
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo:s0105",
      "video_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo",
      "idx": 105,
      "start_s": 354.68,
      "end_s": 361.32,
      "text": "You've been burying yourself your whole life.",
      "n_words": 7
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo:s0106",
      "video_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo",
      "idx": 106,
      "start_s": 359.24,
      "end_s": 369.48,
      "text": "Somewhere, there's an old teacher who taught you to read, the clerk who handed you your first paycheck, the neighbor who watched you grow up.",
      "n_words": 25
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo:s0107",
      "video_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo",
      "idx": 107,
      "start_s": 366.0,
      "end_s": 371.16,
      "text": "They thought about you for years.",
      "n_words": 6
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo:s0108",
      "video_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo",
      "idx": 108,
      "start_s": 369.48,
      "end_s": 373.20000000000005,
      "text": "You can't picture their faces.",
      "n_words": 5
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo:s0109",
      "video_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo",
      "idx": 109,
      "start_s": 369.48,
      "end_s": 375.96000000000004,
      "text": "You're not just being forgotten.",
      "n_words": 5
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo:s0110",
      "video_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo",
      "idx": 110,
      "start_s": 371.16,
      "end_s": 378.0,
      "text": "You're forgetting just as fast.",
      "n_words": 5
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo:s0111",
      "video_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo",
      "idx": 111,
      "start_s": 373.2,
      "end_s": 382.52,
      "text": "Your body is gone first, then the people who loved you start forgetting.",
      "n_words": 13
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo:s0112",
      "video_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo",
      "idx": 112,
      "start_s": 378.0,
      "end_s": 382.52,
      "text": "Your name follows.",
      "n_words": 3
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo:s0113",
      "video_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo",
      "idx": 113,
      "start_s": 380.08,
      "end_s": 385.0,
      "text": "And cremation doesn't save anyone.",
      "n_words": 5
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo:s0114",
      "video_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo",
      "idx": 114,
      "start_s": 380.08,
      "end_s": 388.28,
      "text": "Ashes get scattered, lost, thrown out.",
      "n_words": 6
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo:s0115",
      "video_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo",
      "idx": 115,
      "start_s": 382.52,
      "end_s": 391.28,
      "text": "A few names do last for millennia.",
      "n_words": 7
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo:s0116",
      "video_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo",
      "idx": 116,
      "start_s": 385.0,
      "end_s": 393.28,
      "text": "Socrates, Buddha, Tutankhamun.",
      "n_words": 3
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo:s0117",
      "video_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo",
      "idx": 117,
      "start_s": 388.28,
      "end_s": 395.84,
      "text": "About 100 names out of 100 billion lives.",
      "n_words": 8
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo:s0118",
      "video_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo",
      "idx": 118,
      "start_s": 391.28,
      "end_s": 399.79999999999995,
      "text": "If we're being honest, for average people like us, the math isn't on our side.",
      "n_words": 15
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo:s0119",
      "video_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo",
      "idx": 119,
      "start_s": 395.84,
      "end_s": 401.96,
      "text": "You're not waiting to be forgotten.",
      "n_words": 6
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo:s0120",
      "video_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo",
      "idx": 120,
      "start_s": 397.68,
      "end_s": 403.76,
      "text": "You're already mostly forgotten.",
      "n_words": 4
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo:s0121",
      "video_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo",
      "idx": 121,
      "start_s": 399.8,
      "end_s": 405.71999999999997,
      "text": "8 billion people are alive right now.",
      "n_words": 7
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo:s0122",
      "video_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo",
      "idx": 122,
      "start_s": 401.96,
      "end_s": 408.24,
      "text": "They don't know your name.",
      "n_words": 5
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo:s0123",
      "video_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo",
      "idx": 123,
      "start_s": 403.76,
      "end_s": 409.8,
      "text": "The billions who haven't been born yet won't either.",
      "n_words": 9
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo:s0124",
      "video_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo",
      "idx": 124,
      "start_s": 405.72,
      "end_s": 415.12,
      "text": "The grave just finishes what indifference already started.",
      "n_words": 8
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo:s0125",
      "video_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo",
      "idx": 125,
      "start_s": 409.8,
      "end_s": 415.12,
      "text": "Some people get ahead of this.",
      "n_words": 6
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo:s0126",
      "video_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo",
      "idx": 126,
      "start_s": 412.0,
      "end_s": 416.919,
      "text": "Genghis Khan died in 1227.",
      "n_words": 5
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo:s0127",
      "video_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo",
      "idx": 127,
      "start_s": 412.0,
      "end_s": 418.8,
      "text": "He ordered his grave hidden.",
      "n_words": 5
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo:s0128",
      "video_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo",
      "idx": 128,
      "start_s": 415.12,
      "end_s": 429.56,
      "text": "The traditional accounts include soldiers killing witnesses, horses trampling the ground flat, and a river diverted over the site.",
      "n_words": 19
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo:s0129",
      "video_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo",
      "idx": 129,
      "start_s": 423.36,
      "end_s": 433.96,
      "text": "800 years later, after expeditions and modern satellite surveys, nobody has found his tomb.",
      "n_words": 14
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo:s0130",
      "video_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo",
      "idx": 130,
      "start_s": 429.56,
      "end_s": 437.28,
      "text": "He's somewhere under a Mongolian hill.",
      "n_words": 6
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo:s0131",
      "video_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo",
      "idx": 131,
      "start_s": 431.84,
      "end_s": 440.2,
      "text": "Most of us are forgotten by accident.",
      "n_words": 7
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo:s0132",
      "video_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo",
      "idx": 132,
      "start_s": 433.96,
      "end_s": 440.2,
      "text": "He chose it.",
      "n_words": 3
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo:s0133",
      "video_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo",
      "idx": 133,
      "start_s": 433.96,
      "end_s": 444.64,
      "text": "You've already been dead for 13 billion years before you were born.",
      "n_words": 12
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo:s0134",
      "video_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo",
      "idx": 134,
      "start_s": 440.2,
      "end_s": 444.64,
      "text": "You didn't exist.",
      "n_words": 3
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo:s0135",
      "video_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo",
      "idx": 135,
      "start_s": 440.2,
      "end_s": 446.71999999999997,
      "text": "The universe was running fine.",
      "n_words": 5
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo:s0136",
      "video_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo",
      "idx": 136,
      "start_s": 442.28,
      "end_s": 455.44,
      "text": "Stars dying, empires rising and falling, people getting married, having children, building cities, making art, fighting wars.",
      "n_words": 17
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo:s0137",
      "video_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo",
      "idx": 137,
      "start_s": 450.4,
      "end_s": 455.44,
      "text": "Not one of them missed you.",
      "n_words": 6
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo:s0138",
      "video_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo",
      "idx": 138,
      "start_s": 453.0,
      "end_s": 457.04,
      "text": "You hadn't happened yet.",
      "n_words": 4
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo:s0139",
      "video_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo",
      "idx": 139,
      "start_s": 453.0,
      "end_s": 459.12,
      "text": "When you die, you'll go right back to it.",
      "n_words": 9
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo:s0140",
      "video_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo",
      "idx": 140,
      "start_s": 455.44,
      "end_s": 463.68,
      "text": "People imagine death as a person trapped in the dark.",
      "n_words": 10
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo:s0141",
      "video_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo",
      "idx": 141,
      "start_s": 459.12,
      "end_s": 463.68,
      "text": "It's not that.",
      "n_words": 3
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo:s0142",
      "video_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo",
      "idx": 142,
      "start_s": 459.12,
      "end_s": 466.15999999999997,
      "text": "It's exactly what came before.",
      "n_words": 5
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo:s0143",
      "video_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo",
      "idx": 143,
      "start_s": 461.4,
      "end_s": 466.15999999999997,
      "text": "And that part was fine.",
      "n_words": 5
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo:s0144",
      "video_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo",
      "idx": 144,
      "start_s": 463.68,
      "end_s": 468.72,
      "text": "Something does survive.",
      "n_words": 3
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo:s0145",
      "video_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo",
      "idx": 145,
      "start_s": 463.68,
      "end_s": 477.48,
      "text": "The way your grandfather said one specific word, which your parent picked up, which you picked up, which your kid will use in conversations you'll never hear.",
      "n_words": 27
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo:s0146",
      "video_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo",
      "idx": 146,
      "start_s": 472.8,
      "end_s": 479.52,
      "text": "The recipe nobody remembers learning.",
      "n_words": 5
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo:s0147",
      "video_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo",
      "idx": 147,
      "start_s": 475.0,
      "end_s": 486.84000000000003,
      "text": "The kind thing someone said to you in a bad year, which you said to somebody else 15 years later.",
      "n_words": 20
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo:s0148",
      "video_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo",
      "idx": 148,
      "start_s": 482.24,
      "end_s": 488.92,
      "text": "Nothing of you survives by name.",
      "n_words": 6
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo:s0149",
      "video_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo",
      "idx": 149,
      "start_s": 484.56,
      "end_s": 491.08,
      "text": "Versions of you survive constantly.",
      "n_words": 5
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo:s0150",
      "video_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo",
      "idx": 150,
      "start_s": 486.84,
      "end_s": 492.84000000000003,
      "text": "Most of your life is the boring stuff.",
      "n_words": 8
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo:s0151",
      "video_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo",
      "idx": 151,
      "start_s": 488.92,
      "end_s": 496.59999999999997,
      "text": "The ordinary Tuesdays, the hour cooking dinner with music on, the walk you took for no reason.",
      "n_words": 17
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo:s0152",
      "video_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo",
      "idx": 152,
      "start_s": 492.84,
      "end_s": 498.64,
      "text": "None of it will make it into the obituary.",
      "n_words": 9
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo:s0153",
      "video_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo",
      "idx": 153,
      "start_s": 494.88,
      "end_s": 501.84000000000003,
      "text": "None of it is supposed to.",
      "n_words": 6
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo:s0154",
      "video_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo",
      "idx": 154,
      "start_s": 496.6,
      "end_s": 503.71999999999997,
      "text": "That's where you actually live.",
      "n_words": 5
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo:s0155",
      "video_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo",
      "idx": 155,
      "start_s": 498.64,
      "end_s": 503.71999999999997,
      "text": "This isn't a curse.",
      "n_words": 4
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo:s0156",
      "video_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo",
      "idx": 156,
      "start_s": 498.64,
      "end_s": 505.84,
      "text": "It's the point.",
      "n_words": 3
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo:s0157",
      "video_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo",
      "idx": 157,
      "start_s": 501.84,
      "end_s": 508.20000000000005,
      "text": "Permanence would be a punishment.",
      "n_words": 5
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo:s0158",
      "video_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo",
      "idx": 158,
      "start_s": 503.72,
      "end_s": 513.36,
      "text": "Imagine being remembered forever, watched forever, judged forever.",
      "n_words": 8
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo:s0159",
      "video_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo",
      "idx": 159,
      "start_s": 508.2,
      "end_s": 515.599,
      "text": "Your worst day on permanent record.",
      "n_words": 6
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo:s0160",
      "video_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo",
      "idx": 160,
      "start_s": 511.0,
      "end_s": 518.24,
      "text": "The forgetting is what lets every generation start clean.",
      "n_words": 9
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo:s0161",
      "video_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo",
      "idx": 161,
      "start_s": 513.36,
      "end_s": 521.0,
      "text": "It's what lets your shame have an end.",
      "n_words": 8
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo:s0162",
      "video_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo",
      "idx": 162,
      "start_s": 515.599,
      "end_s": 523.28,
      "text": "Mortality isn't punishment.",
      "n_words": 3
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo:s0163",
      "video_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo",
      "idx": 163,
      "start_s": 518.24,
      "end_s": 523.28,
      "text": "It's mercy.",
      "n_words": 2
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo:s0164",
      "video_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo",
      "idx": 164,
      "start_s": 518.24,
      "end_s": 525.839,
      "text": "This is already happening.",
      "n_words": 4
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo:s0165",
      "video_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo",
      "idx": 165,
      "start_s": 521.0,
      "end_s": 528.48,
      "text": "Right now, people are being erased on a precise schedule.",
      "n_words": 10
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo:s0166",
      "video_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo",
      "idx": 166,
      "start_s": 523.28,
      "end_s": 530.5600000000001,
      "text": "Some died last week.",
      "n_words": 4
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo:s0167",
      "video_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo",
      "idx": 167,
      "start_s": 525.839,
      "end_s": 531.96,
      "text": "Some died 80 years ago, and the schedule just caught up.",
      "n_words": 11
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo:s0168",
      "video_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo",
      "idx": 168,
      "start_s": 528.48,
      "end_s": 536.76,
      "text": "It's already happening to your great-grandparents.",
      "n_words": 6
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo:s0169",
      "video_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo",
      "idx": 169,
      "start_s": 531.96,
      "end_s": 542.0,
      "text": "Your grandparents are next, then your parents, then you.",
      "n_words": 9
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo:s0170",
      "video_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo",
      "idx": 170,
      "start_s": 536.76,
      "end_s": 544.04,
      "text": "The only question is the order and how it happens.",
      "n_words": 10
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo:s0171",
      "video_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo",
      "idx": 171,
      "start_s": 539.76,
      "end_s": 545.4,
      "text": "Because eventually, there is no one left who knew you.",
      "n_words": 10
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo:s0172",
      "video_id": "LYMwaaRZ-wo",
      "idx": 172,
      "start_s": 542.0,
      "end_s": 547.92,
      "text": "Or anyone left who didn't.",
      "n_words": 5
    }
  ]
}